== Recommendation 1: Implement Lua-Based Validation (P0) ==

=== Problem ===
Current templates use nested `#if` parser functions for validation, which:
* Don't actually halt execution on validation failure
* Allow `#set` to execute with empty/default values
* Create false sense of security with error messages

=== Solution ===
Create centralized Lua validation modules that:
* Strictly validate all required fields before any SMW operations
* Return error HTML that blocks template rendering
* Centralize controlled vocabulary definitions
* Provide consistent error messaging

=== Implementation ===

'''Step 1: Create Module:ValidatorBase'''
```lua
local p = {}

-- Controlled vocabularies
local VOCABS = {
    epistemic_status = {["Hypothetical"]=true, ["Provisional"]=true, ["Established"]=true, ["Deprecated"]=true},
    stability_class = {["Volatile"]=true, ["Evolving"]=true, ["Stable"]=true, ["Canonical"]=true},
    concept_type = {["Theory"]=true, ["Model"]=true, ["Framework"]=true, ["Principle"]=true, ["Pattern"]=true}
}

function p.validate_required(args, fields)
    local missing = {}
    for _, f in ipairs(fields) do
        if not args[f] or args[f]:match("^%s*$") then
            table.insert(missing, f)
        end
    end
    return #missing == 0, missing
end

function p.validate_vocab(value, vocab_name)
    if not value or value == "" then return true end
    local vocab = VOCABS[vocab_name]
    if not vocab then return false, "Unknown vocab: " .. vocab_name end
    if vocab[value] then return true end
    local valid = {}
    for k, _ in pairs(vocab) do table.insert(valid, k) end
    return false, "Invalid '" .. value .. "'. Valid: " .. table.concat(valid, ", ")
end

function p.render_error(errors)
    local html = '<div class="bitwiki-validation-error">'
    html = html .. "<strong>Template Error:</strong><ul>"
    for _, e in ipairs(errors) do
        html = html .. "<li>" .. e .. "</li>"
    end
    return html .. "</ul></div>"
end

return p
```

'''Step 2: Update Template'''
```mediawiki
{{#invoke:InfoboxValidator|concept
  |title={{{title|}}}
  |definition={{{definition|}}}
  |domain={{{domain|}}}
}}
```

=== Risk Assessment ===
* '''Risk:''' Low - Lua modules are well-established in MediaWiki
* '''Mitigation:''' Test thoroughly in staging environment
* '''Rollback:''' Revert to previous template version

=== Testing ===
* [ ] Test with all required fields
* [ ] Test with each required field missing
* [ ] Test with invalid vocab values
* [ ] Verify no SMW properties set on validation failure

