== Recommendation 5: Create CSS Theme System (P1) ==

=== Problem ===
Inline styles throughout templates make theming difficult and create fragility.

=== Solution ===
Move all styling to MediaWiki:Common.css with semantic class names.

=== Implementation ===

'''Step 1: Create CSS Classes'''
```css
/* MediaWiki:Common.css */

/* Infobox base */
.bitwiki-infobox {
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #ccc);
    border-radius: 4px;
    margin: 0.5em 0;
}

.bitwiki-infobox-header {
    background: var(--header-bg, #f5f5f5);
    padding: 0.5em 1em;
    font-weight: bold;
}

/* Epistemic badges */
.bitwiki-epistemic-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.2em 0.5em;
    border-radius: 3px;
    font-size: 0.85em;
}

.bitwiki-epistemic-established { background: #d4edda; color: #155724; }
.bitwiki-epistemic-provisional { background: #fff3cd; color: #856404; }
.bitwiki-epistemic-hypothetical { background: #f8d7da; color: #721c24; }
.bitwiki-epistemic-deprecated { background: #e2e3e5; color: #383d41; }

/* Validation errors */
.bitwiki-validation-error {
    background: #f8d7da;
    border: 1px solid #f5c6cb;
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 10px 15px;
    margin: 10px 0;
    color: #721c24;
}

/* Responsive */
@media (max-width: 768px) {
    .bitwiki-infobox { width: 100%; }
}
```

'''Step 2: Update Templates'''
```mediawiki
<!-- Before -->
<span style="background: #d4edda; padding: 0.2em 0.5em; border-radius: 3px;">Established</span>

<!-- After -->
<span class="bitwiki-epistemic-badge bitwiki-epistemic-established">Established</span>
```

=== Risk Assessment ===
* '''Risk:''' Low - CSS changes are reversible
* '''Mitigation:''' Test on multiple browsers
* '''Rollback:''' Revert CSS file

